    [21343]={name="Enigma Robes",sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest “Enigma Robes”. In Ahn'Qiraj.",zone="Ahn'Qiraj",questName="Enigma Robes",lore="The unmentionable Old God slowly awakens from his slumber beneath Ahn'Qiraj. The terrible fate that awaits Azeroth could come in days or years; time has no meaning for beings of his power."},
    [21344]={name="Enigma Boots",sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest “Enigma Boots”. In Ahn'Qiraj.",zone="Ahn'Qiraj",questName="Enigma Boots",lore="The most powerful qiraji wield items of such might, they'd give pause even to a dragon. Bring me the qiraji bindings of dominance and other minor components by and I'll create a set of powerful boots for you."},
    [21461]={name="Leggings of the Black Blizzard",sourceType="boss_drop",instructions="Drops from Ossirian the Unscarred in Ruins of Ahn'Qiraj.",zone="Ruins of Ahn'Qiraj",npc="Ossirian the Unscarred",lore="A qiraji lieutenant holding the Ruins, whose name stopped being accurate the first time a raid used the crystals against him."},
    [21471]={name="Talon of Furious Concentration",sourceType="boss_drop",instructions="Drops from Moam in Ruins of Ahn'Qiraj.",zone="Ruins of Ahn'Qiraj",npc="Moam",lore="A stone giant pressed into qiraji service, who drains the mana of everyone fighting him and turns to rock when full."},
    [21565]={name="Rune of Perfection",sourceType="vendor",instructions="Bought from Illiyana Moonblaze in Mor'shan Base Camp — costs tokens or reputation.",zone="Mor'shan Base Camp",npc="Illiyana Moonblaze"},
    [21566]={name="Rune of Perfection",sourceType="vendor",instructions="Bought from Illiyana Moonblaze in Mor'shan Base Camp — costs tokens or reputation.",zone="Mor'shan Base Camp",npc="Illiyana Moonblaze"},
    [21585]={name="Dark Storm Gauntlets",sourceType="boss_drop",instructions="Drops from C'Thun in Temple of Ahn'Qiraj.",zone="Temple of Ahn'Qiraj",npc="C'Thun",lore="An Old God, buried under Ahn'Qiraj by the titans rather than killed. It has been whispering to the qiraji ever since, and the whole war exists because it never stopped."},
    [21597]={name="Royal Scepter of Vek'lor",sourceType="boss_drop",instructions="Drops from Emperor Vek'lor in Temple of Ahn'Qiraj.",zone="Temple of Ahn'Qiraj",npc="Emperor Vek'lor",lore="Twin emperor of the qiraji, and the one who inherited C'Thun's gift for magic instead of his brother's strength. Neither twin can be killed far from the other."},
    [21600]={name="Boots of Epiphany",sourceType="boss_drop",instructions="Drops from Emperor Vek'lor in Temple of Ahn'Qiraj.",zone="Temple of Ahn'Qiraj",npc="Emperor Vek'lor",lore="Twin emperor of the qiraji, and the one who inherited C'Thun's gift for magic instead of his brother's strength. Neither twin can be killed far from the other."},
    [21603]={name="Wand of Qiraji Nobility",sourceType="boss_drop",instructions="Drops from Lord Kri in Temple of Ahn'Qiraj.",zone="Temple of Ahn'Qiraj",npc="Lord Kri",lore="One of the three qiraji councillors who fight as one -- kill any of them and the survivors grow stronger."},
    [21608]={name="Amulet of Vek'nilash",sourceType="boss_drop",instructions="Drops from Emperor Vek'nilash in Temple of Ahn'Qiraj.",zone="Temple of Ahn'Qiraj",npc="Emperor Vek'nilash",lore="Twin emperor of the qiraji, and the stronger arm of the pair. Kill one and the other heals him, so both must fall together."},
    [21611]={name="Burrower Bracers",sourceType="boss_drop",instructions="Drops from Ouro.",npc="Ouro",lore="A sandworm grown enormous under the desert, surfacing only to feed."},
    [21676]={name="Leggings of the Festering Swarm",sourceType="boss_drop",instructions="Drops from Battleguard Sartura in Temple of Ahn'Qiraj.",zone="Temple of Ahn'Qiraj",npc="Battleguard Sartura",lore="The qiraji empire's finest soldier, who fights with her honour guard and refuses to be separated from them."},
    [21709]={name="Ring of the Fallen God",sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest “The Savior of Kalimdor” — pick it over the other choices. In Ahn'Qiraj.",zone="Ahn'Qiraj",questName="The Savior of Kalimdor",lore="To the Caverns of Time you go, Lord:Lady;. Anachronos awaits your return. Give him the eye of C'Thun as he will undoubtedly wish to place it in his master's collection."},
    [22064]={name="Sorcerer's Boots",sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest “Anthion's Parting Words”. In Ironforge.",zone="Ironforge",questName="Anthion's Parting Words",lore="Valthalak's soul was stored in this amulet. In our greed we foolishly split it into three parts, not knowing the curse that would await us. The only way to stop Valthalak's spell is to put the medallion back together."},
    [22065]={name="Sorcerer's Crown",sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest “Saving the Best for Last”. In Ironforge.",zone="Ironforge",questName="Saving the Best for Last",lore="That's an amazing story! You have my thanks, and the heartfelt gratitude of all who were involved. Now maybe I'll be able to sleep at night with both eyes shut."},
    [22066]={name="Sorcerer's Gloves",sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest “Just Compensation”. In Ironforge.",zone="Ironforge",questName="Just Compensation",lore="I believe a reward is in order if I'm to keep you interested in saving my skin. Bring me an ordinary belt and a set of gloves that you wish to upgrade."},
    [22234]={name="Mantle of Lost Hope",sourceType="boss_drop",instructions="Drops from Lord Roccor in Blackrock Depths.",zone="Blackrock Depths",npc="Lord Roccor"},
    [22253]={name="Tome of the Lost",sourceType="boss_drop",instructions="Drops from General Drakkisath in Blackrock Spire.",zone="Blackrock Spire",npc="General Drakkisath"},
    [22254]={name="Wand of Eternal Light",sourceType="world_drop",instructions="Drops from Watchman Doomgrip (rare elite).",npc="Watchman Doomgrip"},
    [22256]={name="Mana Shaping Handwraps",sourceType="world_drop",instructions="Drops from Watchman Doomgrip (rare elite).",npc="Watchman Doomgrip"},
    [22329]={name="Scepter of Interminable Focus",sourceType="object_drop",instructions="Found in a container.",npc="a container"},
    [22335]={name="Lord Valthalak's Staff of Command",sourceType="boss_drop",instructions="Drops from Lord Valthalak.",npc="Lord Valthalak"},
    [22339]={name="Rune Band of Wizardry",sourceType="boss_drop",instructions="Drops from Lord Valthalak.",npc="Lord Valthalak"},
    [22403]={name="Nacreous Shell Necklace",sourceType="boss_drop",instructions="Drops from Cannon Master Willey in Stratholme.",zone="Stratholme",npc="Cannon Master Willey"},
    [22408]={name="Ritssyn's Wand of Bad Mojo",sourceType="boss_drop",instructions="Drops from Baron Rivendare in Stratholme.",zone="Stratholme",npc="Baron Rivendare"},
    [22433]={name="Don Mauricio's Band of Domination",sourceType="world_drop",instructions="Drops from Darkmaster Gandling (rare elite).",npc="Darkmaster Gandling"},
    [22496]={name="Frostfire Robe",sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest “Frostfire Robe”. In Naxxramas.",zone="Naxxramas",questName="Frostfire Robe",lore="While the majority of the books were filled with - to put it bluntly - tripe, there were some gems. One of those tomes documented the creation of a set of armor fit for an archmage: Frostfire."},
    [22498]={name="Frostfire Circlet",sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest “Frostfire Circlet”. In Naxxramas.",zone="Naxxramas",questName="Frostfire Circlet",lore="While the majority of the books were filled with - to put it bluntly - tripe, there were some gems. One of those tomes documented the creation of a set of armor fit for an archmage: Frostfire."},
